{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はかなメルで服買ったと言ってたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香とみさみさがWキャストで出演してる舞台\n「Mr.カミナリ」\nを観に行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は玲香の回でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/06/8449717/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃおもしろかった(*°-°*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も声だして笑っちゃった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドリブとかも面白くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しみじみ\n舞台は生き物なんだなと感じました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/06/8449717/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと玲香！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香が綺麗で輝いてて\nいつもの玲香じゃないみたいでした！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/06/8449717/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、普段をdisってるみたいになったけど(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく\n玲香が素敵でした！\nかっこよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の全員で笑いを共有できる\nこういう舞台が好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また観たいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/11/06/8449717/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler